[{"id":"fm-core2-2.59-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>By first sketching a graph, find the values when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{x+2}\\leq0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving your answer in set notation.</p>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-2,y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0,y=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/solutions/assets/diagrams/259-p1-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,x&lt;-2\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.59-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Each of the following graphs show curves <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, for a constant <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> which intersect at the given points in terms of constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p>In each case, determine the values for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\leq k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving your answer in interval notation in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/questions/assets/diagrams/259-question-2a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/questions/assets/diagrams/259-question-2b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/questions/assets/diagrams/259-question-2c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\in[a,-\\frac12)\\cup(1,b]\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\in(-1,a]\\cup[b,\\frac52)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\in[a,-1)\\cup(\\frac23,3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.59-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Solve each of the following equalities, giving your answer in interval notation:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{x^2-4}\\leq0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{6+5x-x^2}&lt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{x^2-4}=\\frac1{(x-2)(x+2)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-2,x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Min at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,-4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> becomes local max at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,-\\frac14)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^+\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^+\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/solutions/assets/diagrams/259-p2-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x\\in(-2,2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{6+5x-x^2}=\\frac1{-(x+1)(x-6)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0,y=\\frac16\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1,x=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Max at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\frac52,\\frac{49}4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> becomes local max at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\frac52,\\frac4{49})\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^-\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^-\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to6\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to6\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/solutions/assets/diagrams/259-p3-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x\\in(-\\infty,-1)\\cup(6,\\infty)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.59-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Solve each of the following equalities, giving your answer in set notation:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{x^2-9}&gt;\\frac16\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{x(x-1)(x+4)}\\leq0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{x^2-9}=\\frac1{(x-3)(x+3)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0,y=-\\frac19\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-3,x=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Min at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,-9)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> becomes local max at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,-\\frac19)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^+\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^+\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/solutions/assets/diagrams/259-p4-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac16=\\frac1{x^2-9}\\Rightarrow x^2-9=6\\Rightarrow x^2-15=0\\therefore x=\\pm\\sqrt{15}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,-\\sqrt{15}&lt;x&lt;-3\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,3&lt;x&lt;\\sqrt{15}\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-4,x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^-\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^+\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/solutions/assets/diagrams/259-p5-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,x&lt;-4\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,0&lt;x&lt;1\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.59-q5","number":5,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4x-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a factor of</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=12x^3+x^2-9x+2\" data-display=\"true\"></span></li><li><p>Sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1{12x^3+x^2-9x+2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Hence solve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{12x^3+x^2-9x+2}&lt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer in set notation.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f\\left(\\frac14\\right)=12\\left(\\frac14\\right)^3+\\left(\\frac14\\right)^2-9\\left(\\frac14\\right)+2=\\frac3{16}+\\frac1{16}-\\frac94+2=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore(4x-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a factor of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=12x^3+x^2-9x+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"12x^3+x^2-9x+2=(4x-1)(3x^2+x-2)=(4x-1)(3x-2)(x+1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{12x^3+x^2-9x+2}=\\frac1{(4x-1)(3x-2)(x+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0,y=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1,x=\\frac14,x=\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^-\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^+\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/solutions/assets/diagrams/259-p6-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,x&lt;-1\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\frac14&lt;x&lt;\\frac23\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.59-q6","number":6,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3x-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a factor of</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=6x^3-5x^2-2x+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span></li><li><p>On the same set of axes sketch the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1{6x^3-5x^2-2x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p>You do not need to label the points of intersection.</p></li><li><p>Hence solve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{6x^3-5x^2-2x+1}&lt;1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer in interval notation.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f\\left(\\frac13\\right)=6\\left(\\frac13\\right)^3-5\\left(\\frac13\\right)^2-2\\left(\\frac13\\right)+1=\\frac29-\\frac59-\\frac23+1=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore(3x-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a factor of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=6x^3-5x^2-2x+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"6x^3-5x^2-2x+1=(3x-1)(2x^2-x-1)=(3x-1)(2x+1)(x-1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{6x^3-5x^2-2x+1}=\\frac1{(3x-1)(2x+1)(x-1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0,y=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac12,x=\\frac13,x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^-\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\infty,\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to0^+\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from LHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from RHS <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/solutions/assets/diagrams/259-p7-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{6x^3-5x^2-2x+1}=1\\Rightarrow1=6x^3-5x^2-2x+1\\Rightarrow6x^3-5x^2-2x=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow x(6x^2-5x-2)=0\\therefore x=0,x=\\frac5{12}\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{73}}{12}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx\\in(-\\infty,-\\frac12)\\cup(\\frac5{12}-\\frac{\\sqrt{73}}{12},0)\\cup(\\frac13,1)\\cup(\\frac5{12}+\\frac{\\sqrt{73}}{12},\\infty)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.59-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>The curve given by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\mathrm f(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=x(x-k)(x+k)\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive integer is shown in the diagram below.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/questions/assets/diagrams/259-question-7.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Sketch the graph of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1{\\mathrm f(x)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Hence, solve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{x(x-k)(x+k)}&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p>Give your answer in set notation.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.59/solutions/assets/diagrams/259-p8-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,-k&lt;x&lt;0\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,x&gt;k\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]